      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wellman%2C_Iowa",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "North Park offers light‑ed tennis courts, baseball diamonds, a playground, a YMCA, and a band shelter for community events.",
